> a blessed rustproof +2 pair of gauntlets of power (being worn)
> an uncursed +0 cloak of magic resistance (being worn)

> a blessed scroll of charging
> a wand of wishing (0:0)

recharge that wand now and stash it somewhere safe, like in the Bag of
